      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_b687e2957d3ae013_1",
        "edit": "No change: the candidate RTL is identical to the current buggy RTL. The reported temporal divergence (candidate lags golden at cycle_8_plus on Q) is not addressable by a local block edit within the given scope, since the counter logic already uses nonblocking assignment on the correct clock edge and the failure evidence does not implicate a specific local assignment to modify.",
        "lens_id": "temporal_v1",
